{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both sides need ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription"},{"text":" in the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. Bluetooth failures are ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"},{"text":"s; protocol failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError"},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Share as the holder","anchor":"Share-as-the-holder","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet